C. Incorrect. HIPAA’s general 30-day response period should not replace California’s faster applicable inspection timeline.

D. Incorrect. Access rights are not limited to information originally stored on paper. Electronically maintained records may also be subject to inspection or copying rights.

CTA Exam Strategy: Remember:5 working days = inspection',
