  67 => 
  array (
    'question_text' => 'A former client requests an electronic copy of the complete treatment record. The LCSW maintains the record electronically and can readily produce it in the requested format. The client owes money, has threatened to file a complaint, and may disagree with the LCSW’s diagnosis.The file contains:Ordinary progress notesA treatment planBilling recordsSeparately maintained psychotherapy notesA collateral statement containing sensitive information about a nonclient relativeThe LCSW plans to withhold everything for 30 days until the client pays the balance and agrees not to complain.What is the most appropriate response?',
